        "text": "Savings ClauseAct May 24, 1934, ch. 344, § 5, 48 Stat. 798, provided that the repeal of this section should not affect any right or privilege or terminate any citizenship acquired under the section before such repeal.",
        "role": "",
        "bodyStart": 14,
