        "text": "Short Title of 1976 AmendmentPub. L. 94–571, § 1, Oct. 20, 1976, 90 Stat. 2703, provided: “That this Act [amending this section and sections 1151, 1152 to 1154, 1181, 1182, 1251, 1254, and 1255 of this title and enacting provisions set out as notes under this section and sections 1153 and 1255 of this title] may be cited as the ‘Immigration and Nationality Act Amendments of 1976’.”",
        "role": "",
