        "text": "Repeal and RevivalPub. L. 100–525, § 8(b), Oct. 24, 1988, 102 Stat. 2617, provided that: “Section 3 of INAA [Pub. L. 99–653, repealing subsec. (c)(1) of this section] is repealed and the language stricken by such section is revived as of November 14, 1986.”",
