        "heading": "Special Rule for Alien Victims",
        "text": "Special Rule for Alien VictimsPub. L. 112–239, div. A, title XVII, § 1706(b), Jan. 2, 2013, 126 Stat. 2097, provided that: “No alien may be admitted to the United States pursuant to subparagraph (U) of section 101(a)(15) of the Immigration and Nationality Act (8 U.S.C. 1101(a)(15)) as a result of the alien being a victim of a crime described in subsection (b) of section 1351 of title 18, United States Code, as added by subsection (a).”",
