        "text": "Coordination of Amendments by Pub. L. 104–208Pub. L. 104–208, div. C, § 1(b), Sept. 30, 1996, 110 Stat. 3009–546, provided that: “Except as otherwise specifically provided— “(1) whenever in this division [see Tables for classification] an amendment or repeal is expressed as the amendment or repeal of a section or other provision, the reference shall be considered to be made to that section or provision in the Immigration and Nationality Act [8 U.S.C. 1101 et seq.]; and “(2) amendments to a section or other provision are to such section or other provision before any amendment made to such section or other provision elsewhere in this division.”",
