        "heading": "Notification to Public and Program Recipients of Changes Regarding Eligibility for Programs",
        "text": "Notification to Public and Program Recipients of Changes Regarding Eligibility for ProgramsPub. L. 104–208, div. C, title V, § 593, Sept. 30, 1996, 110 Stat. 3009–688, provided that: “(a) In General.—Each agency of the Federal Government or a State or political subdivision that administers a program affected by the provisions of this title [see Effective Date of 1996 Amendment note above], shall, directly or through the States, provide general notification to the public and to program recipients of the changes regarding eligibility for any such program pursuant to this title. “(b) Failure To Give Notice.—Nothing in this section shall be construed to require or authorize continuation of eligibility if the notice under this section is not provided.”",
