        "heading": "Abolition of Immigration and Naturalization Service and Transfer of Functions",
        "text": "Abolition of Immigration and Naturalization Service and Transfer of Functions For abolition of Immigration and Naturalization Service, transfer of functions, and treatment of related references, see note set out under section 1551 of this title.",
