        "heading": "Inapplicability of Numerical Limitations for Certain Aliens Residing in the United States Virgin Islands",
        "text": "Inapplicability of Numerical Limitations for Certain Aliens Residing in the United States Virgin IslandsThe numerical limitations described in text not to apply in the case of certain aliens residing in the Virgin Islands seeking adjustment of their status to permanent resident alien status, and such adjustment of status not to result in any reduction in the number of aliens who may acquire the status of aliens lawfully admitted to the United States for permanent residence under this chapter, see section 2(c)(1) of Pub. L. 97–271, set out as a note under section 1255 of this title.",
