        "heading": "Immigration Program",
        "text": "Immigration ProgramPub. L. 102–395, title VI, § 610, Oct. 6, 1992, 106 Stat. 1874, as amended by Pub. L. 105–119, title I, § 116(a), Nov. 26, 1997, 111 Stat. 2467; Pub. L. 106–396, § 402, Oct. 30, 2000, 114 Stat. 1647; Pub. L. 107–273, div. C, title I, § 11037(a), Nov. 2, 2002, 116 Stat. 1847; Pub. L. 108–156, § 4, Dec. 3, 2003, 117 Stat. 1945; Pub. L. 111–83, title V, § 548, Oct. 28, 2009, 123 Stat. 2177; Pub. L. 112–176, § 1, Sept. 28, 2012, 126 Stat. 1325, which related to an immigration program to implement section 203(b)(5) of the Immigration and Nationality Act (8 U.S.C. 1153(b)(5)), was repealed by Pub. L. 117–103, div. BB, § 103(a), Mar. 15, 2022, 136 Stat. 1075.",
