        "text": "Delay Until April 1, 1992, in Application of Subsection (g)(1)(C) of This SectionSee section 3 of Pub. L. 102–110, set out as a Delay Until April 1, 1992, in Implementation of Provisions Relating to Nonimmigrant Artists, Athletes, Entertainers, and Fashion Models note under section 1101 of this title.",
