        "heading": "Effective Date of 2007 Amendment",
        "text": "Effective Date of 2007 AmendmentPub. L. 110–53, title VII, § 711(d)(2), Aug. 3, 2007, 121 Stat. 345, provided that: “Section 217(a)(11) of the Immigration and Nationality Act [8 U.S.C. 1187(a)(11)], as added by paragraph (1)(A)(ii), shall take effect on the date that is 60 days after the date on which the Secretary of Homeland Security publishes notice in the Federal Register of the requirement under such paragraph. [Notice published in Federal Register, Nov. 13, 2008, 73 F.R. 67354.]”",
