        "heading": "Effective Date of 1990 Amendment",
        "text": "Effective Date of 1990 AmendmentPub. L. 101–649, title V, § 506(b), Nov. 29, 1990, 104 Stat. 5050, provided that: “The amendment made by subsection (a) [amending this section] shall take effect on the date of the enactment of this Act [Nov. 29, 1990].”",
