        "text": "Effective Date of 1994 AmendmentsAmendment by section 219(h) of Pub. L. 103–416 effective as if included in the enactment of the Immigration Act of 1990, Pub. L. 101–649, see section 219(dd) of Pub. L. 103–416, set out as a note under section 1101 of this title. Pub. L. 103–416, title II, § 224(c), Oct. 25, 1994, 108 Stat. 4324, provided that: “The amendments made by this section [amending this section and section 1252a of this title] shall apply to all aliens whose adjudication of guilt or guilty plea is entered in the record after the date of enactment of this Act [Oct. 25, 1994].” Pub. L. 103–322, title II, § 20301(b), Sept. 13, 1994, 108 Stat. 1824, provided that: “The amendment made by subsection (a) [amending this section] shall take effect October 1, 1994.”",
