        "heading": "Report on Citizenship of Certain Legalized Aliens",
        "text": "Report on Citizenship of Certain Legalized AliensPub. L. 103–416, title I, § 109, Oct. 25, 1994, 108 Stat. 4310, provided that not later than June 30, 1996, the Commissioner of the Immigration and Naturalization Service was to prepare and submit to the Congress a report concerning the citizenship status of aliens legalized under this section and section 1160 of this title.",
