        "heading": "Effective Date of 2008 Amendment",
        "text": "Effective Date of 2008 AmendmentAmendment by Pub. L. 110–181 effective Jan. 28, 2008, and applicable to any application for naturalization or issuance of a certificate of citizenship pending on or after such date, see section 674(d) of Pub. L. 110–181, set out as a note under section 1430 of this title.",
