        "heading": "Eligibility of Certain Cuban-Haitian Entrants Entering After Nov. 1, 1979",
        "text": "Eligibility of Certain Cuban-Haitian Entrants Entering After Nov. 1, 1979Pub. L. 97–35, title V, §§ 543(a)(2), 547, Aug. 13, 1981, 95 Stat. 459, 463, eff. Oct. 1, 1981, provided that: “For purposes of the Refugee Education Assistance Act of 1980 [set out below], an alien who entered the United States on or after November 1, 1979, and is in the United States with the immigration status of a Cuban-Haitian entrant (status pending) shall be considered to be an eligible participant (within the meaning of section 101(3) of such Act) but only during the 36-month period beginning with the first month in which the alien entered the United States as such an entrant or otherwise first acquired such status.”",
